= Tax Cuts and the Budget

Congressional Republicans are pushing through a sweeping tax cut. Critics say it favors the wealthy and balloons the deficit; supporters say it will boost investment.

- @tax_opposition: Unified opposition
- @tax_alternatives: Offer a middle-class alternative

@tax_opposition
on-arrival: progressive_dissent -= 3; working_dem += 2*(1-dissent); suburban_dem += 1*(1-dissent); inequality += 1

We make inequality the center of our message.

